# Indy: charged ollie, L + right held about a third of a second, let go before the
# landing (grab review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/grabs.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap grab+right 96
hold grab 97..140
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Indy} within 120..200
expect no event bail
